Z||000001||cifc||11-22-2000||12:25 AM||||I wouldn't recommend Aiwa mobile products.  I've heard good things about some of their home equipment, but stay away from the car stuff.  They are unreliable at best, and the displays are really hard to read in the sunlight.<BR>--Jason||||reg||1
